ons all heavy bass, drum kits and intense rhythmic elements, relying entirely on soft acoustic and ambient instrumental layers. Core textures include tender crystal piano broken chords, sustained misty ethereal synth pads, smooth looping harp arpeggios, sporadic delicate glockenspiel high-frequency ornaments, and faint lingering violin string pads, matched with ultra-light sand shaker micro-percussion to build a faint flowing steady rhythm. Natural ambient soundscapes of distant gurgling streams and gentle wind leaf rustle run through the whole track with low volume. Lead vocals are soft, breathy and warm with intimate close-range vocal processing, paired with faint layered airy ooh/ah backing harmonies and subtle vocal reverb. The overall mood is tranquil, soothing, transcendent and healing, relieving anxiety and calming the mind. The complete track structure includes atmospheric sparse intro, narrative soft verses, gently uplifting pre-choruses, fully layered luminous choruses, pure instrumental interlude, minimalist empty bridge and slow progressive fading outro, with all instrumental layers rising and receding gently without abrupt changes, maintaining consistent peaceful pastoral atmosphere throughout.","[Intro - Misty airy synth pad fades in slowly, faint distant stream ambient sound, sporadic soft glockenspiel single notes, no percussion]\n(Wordless ethereal ooh hums fade in softly, low-volume wind rustle sound lingers in the background)\n[Verse 1 - Crystal piano broken chords, ultra-light sand shaker steady micro rhythm, faint violin long tone pads]\n(Soft, calm and breathy vocal delivery, gentle slow pacing)\n薄云漫过山脊\n柔光拂过衣袂\n清风携浅草香气\n温度恰好相宜\n俗世喧嚣远去\n天地只剩清寂\n[Pre-Chorus - Continuous flowing harp arpeggios, subtle melodic lift of instrumental layers, faint backing harmonies emerge]\n(Vocal tone brightens slightly, melody rises gently with relaxed breath control)\n赤脚漫步晴野\n万千烦忧慢慢消解\n暖意裹住躯体\n一身轻盈安宁\n[Chorus - Full instrumental layers expand, harp persistent arpeggios, intermittent glockenspiel high accents, wide-reverb ooh backing harmonies, distant bird chirp ambient sampling]\n(Unfolded, relaxed and sustained vocal delivery, open and ethereal breath sense)\n天光漫遍旷野\n清风渡我忘忧界\n草木轻摇 流云慢曳\n一身暖意 不染尘屑\n踏入这片仙境山野\n万物与我两相和解\n(Layered ooh harmonic vocals fluctuate gently in the middle section, then fade softly)\n[Instrumental Interlude - Pure instrumental solo, piano soft harmonic support, continuous harp flow, prominent stream ambient sound, violin string layers sustain the background]\n(No lead vocals, sparse glockenspiel ornamentals embellish the high frequency, overall tone tranquil and empty)\n[Verse 2 - Properly simplified instrumental arrangement, faint melodic counterpoint behind vocals, sand shaker maintains stable weak rhythm]\n(Gentle and quiet vocal delivery, mild and soothing emotional tone)\n薄雾轻笼晴空\n暖阳抚遍山石丛\n无争无扰无匆忙\n旷野安放我心神\n远离闹市纷扰尘\n此间岁月缓无声\n[Pre-Chorus - Harp arpeggios reappear, rhythm slightly elevated, faint backing harmonies float in the background]\n(Vocal melody rises softly, emotion stretches gently and comfortably)\n赤脚漫步晴野\n万千烦忧慢慢消解\n暖意裹住躯体\n一身轻盈安宁\n[Chorus - Complete full-band arrangement, all core instruments fully expanded, wide-field layered harmonic vocals, integrated natural ambient soundscape]\n(Unfolded, powerful yet gentle vocal delivery, full and open emotional expression)\n天光漫遍旷野\n清风渡我忘忧界\n草木轻摇 流云慢曳\n一身暖意 不染尘屑\n踏入这片仙境山野\n万物与我两相和解\n(Layered ooh harmonic vocals fluctuate gently in the middle section, then fade softly)\n[Bridge - Ultra-minimalist and empty arrangement, all percussion withdrawn, only piano overtones, misty synth pads and faint violin long tones retained]\n(Near-whisper vocal delivery, extremely long reverb, large blank auditory space)\n抛开俗世千缕牵绊\n静坐流云漫卷山畔\n不寒不燥天光漫漫\n心神随云自在飘散\n(Echoing ah vocal fragments intersperse between lines, fade out gradually)\n[Outro - Instrumental layers fade out one by one, harp and glockenspiel exit first, piano sparse high notes and synth pads remain, faint stream ambient sound persists]\n(Distant wordless mm hums dissipate with reverb, all sounds fade slowly to complete silence)",0,"fixed",86,200,"4","zh","E minor",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0]},{"id":104,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[-189.9999545008027,-879.9998853049095],"size":[380,90],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"UNet名称","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"数据类型","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[260]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.11.1","Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","models":[{"name":"acestep_v1.5_xl_base_bf16.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/acestep_v1.5_xl_base_bf16.safetensors","directory":"diffusion_models"}],"enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"secondTabWidth":65},"widgets_values":["acestep_v1.5_xl_turbo_bf16.safetensors","default"]},{"id":3,"type":"KSampler","pos":[937.3568445268944,-806.9692889119015],"size":[210,262],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":175},{"localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":254},{"localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":119},{"localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":249},{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":273},{"localized_name":"步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"采样器名称","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMB